#: src/schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.stage-manager.gschema.xml:67
msgid ""
"What to show in sidebar cards. 'groups' = stage manager (swap groups), "
"'apps' = per-app (just focus), 'workspaces' = other workspaces, 'all-"
"windows' = every window on every workspace (click to activate)."
msgstr ""

